        <p>FOR - ,t 1 4,;:A Baby's Bath use . .....,.; ..,..t cusTotAcupßA 'l') ~ y, d ~......„ .4 i ‘\,ii•b.,` \ Ota reek ...t • sslTN‘tj• 411,,Ve•"."---"‘NN, ,i: __ .... _____:„...,...z.. ...... , : ...0...„....._ ..„....,„- *.., " • .....- ''''-'-....•1 4. It Prevents chafing, redness, and roughness of -ue skin, tootling inflammation allays" itchr- ind irritation-Ad when followOd•by gent' DI i Cab one; of ' ,c; 1/intine- to- !loin cure, speesnly cures an i "aly humours aid ressorer</p>
