        <p>An Author's Telling Letter. The well-known Manx author, Mr. C. Frederix Wilson, who, under the pen name of "Max Fax," has written "The Missing Will," " A Woman's Life," His own Enemy," "Brothers," "Trump Cards." " Convict's Daughter," and •' Love And Life,' ' has sent the following letter to the Proprietors of CHAS. FORDE'S BILE I3EANS FOR BILIOUSNESS:— •</p>
