        <p>GitigxxastaN " I should like to inform you that your Bile Beans have done me a wonderful amount of good,. was in the South. of England with an, opera all li:St winter, and scarcely a day passed but what I suffered terrible agony. In the end I became%) bad, that I felt I must terminate rpy engagement and rest, as just a short time after mealsl began to swell with indigestion, the pain being unbearablil. 1 retlirted home no better, and continued to suffer acutely. Eventually I met a friend, an officer on board the "Medic." fie said, —Why don't you try Chas. Forde's Bile BeanS7 " and showed me your. advertise- ment I tried them, and the result was amazing! lam now as well as ever I was in my life. Per- sonally. I am convinced of the excellency of Bile Beans, and if anyone doubts my 'case, let them write, to me personally, or better still give me a call. You can make hill use of this letber if anyway useful to others. , : Touts re:o=th</p>
